sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Employee
  participant A as API + Runtime
  participant G as Supervisor graph
  participant X as Gateway · Policy
  participant S as Stores
  actor M as Manager
  E->>A: "I need FinanceERP access"
  A->>G: run turn
  G->>X: create_access_request (MEDIUM)
  X->>S: AR-1013 awaiting · AP-0001 manager
  G->>S: interrupt() — checkpoint, pause
  A-->>E: "Manager approval is required"
  Note over A,S: process may restart — the pause is durable
  M->>A: approve AP-0001 (comment)
  A->>A: approver rules (not own, right approver, not expired)
  A->>S: audit decision first, then record approval
  A->>G: resume(thread)
  G->>X: provision_access as access_workflow (HIGH)
  X->>S: approval evidence → ALLOW · grant · audit
  G-->>A: "Access has been granted"
  A-->>M: decision + resumed answer
  A-->>E: thread shows the update
